{"ep": "17", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:17.03", "end": "0:00:21.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的  我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:23.36", "end": "0:00:28.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:28.89", "end": "0:00:32.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:32.67", "end": "0:00:36.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:40.80", "end": "0:00:41.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么啦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:42.43", "end": "0:00:43.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:44.46", "end": "0:00:46.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:51.20", "end": "0:00:52.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:52.55", "end": "0:00:55.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 9, "start": "0:01:00.12", "end": "0:01:02.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 10, "start": "0:01:05.19", "end": "0:01:05.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 11, "start": "0:01:05.88", "end": "0:01:07.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 12, "start": "0:01:07.78", "end": "0:01:10.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 13, "start": "0:01:10.12", "end": "0:01:12.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后一定要骑自行车来  Over～"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 14, "start": "0:01:14.60", "end": "0:01:18.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像又知道春日打算要说啥"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:20.89", "end": "0:01:22.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不对"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:23.46", "end": "0:01:27.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说  是感觉之前好像出现过完全相同的事情"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:28.43", "end": "0:01:30.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是所谓的「既视感」么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:37.14", "end": "0:01:38.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天就这样缴枪了啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 19, "start": "0:03:13.16", "end": "0:03:14.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 20, "start": "0:03:14.55", "end": "0:03:15.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 21, "start": "0:03:16.23", "end": "0:03:16.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 22, "start": "0:03:17.27", "end": "0:03:18.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等真抱歉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:18.93", "end": "0:03:21.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:21.16", "end": "0:03:21.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:22.05", "end": "0:03:24.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:24.57", "end": "0:03:26.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从这准备的架势来看也是吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:26.73", "end": "0:03:29.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天要有夏天的样子  不能不做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:30.34", "end": "0:03:33.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:33.72", "end": "0:03:34.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:35.21", "end": "0:03:37.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:38.56", "end": "0:03:40.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便一提我们是骑自行车去泳池"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:41.40", "end": "0:03:42.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们也骑来了么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:43.35", "end": "0:03:46.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  自行车只有你和我的两辆"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:47.30", "end": "0:03:47.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:48.09", "end": "0:03:50.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好了  阿虚  可不能输给古泉哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:51.01", "end": "0:03:52.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  立即出发"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:53.83", "end": "0:03:56.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们两个赶紧停好车！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:56.75", "end": "0:03:59.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  接下来是要玩啊  你怎么就筋疲力尽了？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 39, "start": "0:04:00.19", "end": "0:04:01.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是谁的错啊  谁的啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:02.58", "end": "0:04:06.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:06.77", "end": "0:04:07.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "人山人海的！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:08.05", "end": "0:04:11.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之先放好随身物  然后就去游泳吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:11.62", "end": "0:04:12.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来比赛哦  比赛！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:13.08", "end": "0:04:14.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来了哦  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:14.76", "end": "0:04:15.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:18.28", "end": "0:04:21.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶紧过来  水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:21.58", "end": "0:04:23.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙就看不见那些禁止跳水的文字说明么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:26.17", "end": "0:04:27.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "挺欢乐的嘛"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:28.08", "end": "0:04:31.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是很欢乐的情景  还真让人感到和平呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:32.44", "end": "0:04:37.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:38.29", "end": "0:04:43.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然打个电话过来  单方面地说有事就挂的邀请方式"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:43.69", "end": "0:04:45.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实在不能说得上是常识性的吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:46.12", "end": "0:04:49.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就那点事  要我说根本不算什么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:50.60", "end": "0:04:52.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:54.02", "end": "0:04:56.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:57.20", "end": "0:04:58.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:00.14", "end": "0:05:00.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:02.14", "end": "0:05:02.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:03.24", "end": "0:05:05.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  大概是我的错觉吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:06.23", "end": "0:05:07.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "初春以来发生了种种事情的缘故"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:08.28", "end": "0:05:10.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是变得有点神经质了吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:23.34", "end": "0:05:24.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请喝茶吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:24.43", "end": "0:05:25.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:28.61", "end": "0:05:29.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好好喝哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:30.70", "end": "0:05:33.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  我们再去游泳吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:34.27", "end": "0:05:35.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:35.52", "end": "0:05:39.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:40.33", "end": "0:05:42.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么春日会选这样一个地方来啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:47.51", "end": "0:05:49.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？又来了  这种感觉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:50.75", "end": "0:05:52.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得这种景象以前也见到过"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:53.38", "end": "0:05:55.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥觉得长门好像有些无聊…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:56.73", "end": "0:05:57.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:58.58", "end": "0:06:01.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  然后春日说了这种话"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:01.81", "end": "0:06:03.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:03.88", "end": "0:06:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:07.36", "end": "0:06:08.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  要玩了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:08.64", "end": "0:06:09.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中足球吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:11.70", "end": "0:06:12.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:13.08", "end": "0:06:14.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  这种事也常有"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:14.60", "end": "0:06:15.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:16.11", "end": "0:06:17.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我来了  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:25.56", "end": "0:06:28.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我试着考虑了下今后的活动计划  如何呢？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:29.55", "end": "0:06:30.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是啥"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:31.07", "end": "0:06:34.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剩余不多的暑假该如何度过的预定表啦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:35.27", "end": "0:06:39.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然发现  暑假只剩下两个星期了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:39.84", "end": "0:06:41.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我都愕然了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:42.10", "end": "0:06:45.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明还剩下很多事情想要去做"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:45.67", "end": "0:06:47.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但只剩这么一点点时间"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:48.41", "end": "0:06:49.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后要赶快地去玩啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:50.40", "end": "0:06:52.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要整整两个星期吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:52.85", "end": "0:06:54.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:55.74", "end": "0:06:59.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 93, "start": "0:06:59.54", "end": "0:07:03.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK  捞…金…鱼…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:05.07", "end": "0:07:05.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:10.37", "end": "0:07:11.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:12.61", "end": "0:07:15.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:15.71", "end": "0:07:17.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查一下吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:17.39", "end": "0:07:18.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那麻烦了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:19.19", "end": "0:07:20.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:21.15", "end": "0:07:22.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就到此为止啦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:30.91", "end": "0:07:31.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:33.34", "end": "0:07:35.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  其实也没有什么事"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:36.92", "end": "0:07:39.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近如何  精神好么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:40.30", "end": "0:07:40.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:44.27", "end": "0:07:46.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那…那太好了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:47.08", "end": "0:07:47.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:52.39", "end": "0:07:55.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  为什么我会去搭腔呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 108, "start": "0:08:04.77", "end": "0:08:05.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以走了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:11.24", "end": "0:08:15.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天早晨  将我的懒觉夺走的又是春日一通电话"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:16.20", "end": "0:08:18.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "似乎是说找到盂兰盆会的会场了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:18.48", "end": "0:08:20.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们大伙一起去买浴衣吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:20.45", "end": "0:08:23.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠和有希都说没有"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:23.39", "end": "0:08:26.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也没有  又找到了买一整套的话就会便宜的店"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:26.79", "end": "0:08:27.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一起去吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:27.78", "end": "0:08:30.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日进了女装的大卖场之后"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:30.57", "end": "0:08:32.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "擅自为朝比奈学姐和长门挑选了浴衣"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:33.09", "end": "0:08:35.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后毫不客气地冲进了试衣间"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:35.54", "end": "0:08:37.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后我们等了大约一小时"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:37.86", "end": "0:08:38.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  太耀眼了！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:39.89", "end": "0:08:41.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  都非常合适哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:42.43", "end": "0:08:44.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然啦  是我给挑选的嘛"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:45.26", "end": "0:08:46.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:46.71", "end": "0:08:49.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好可爱  真不愧是我挑的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:50.01", "end": "0:08:51.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是…是"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:51.75", "end": "0:08:53.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐  正点！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:57.38", "end": "0:09:00.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有实玖瑠想要玩的捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:00.23", "end": "0:09:01.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去捞个痛快吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:02.06", "end": "0:09:06.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "盂兰盆会啊  真亏得能聚集起这么多人啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:07.45", "end": "0:09:08.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:09.61", "end": "0:09:13.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明应该是很久没来了  却觉得最近就来过"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:14.67", "end": "0:09:15.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个楼塔"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:15.85", "end": "0:09:16.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个摊子"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:18.87", "end": "0:09:22.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吧  来一决高下如何"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:24.32", "end": "0:09:25.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "交给我吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:26.39", "end": "0:09:27.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:29.46", "end": "0:09:30.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起这个来  长门"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:31.07", "end": "0:09:32.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要吃点什么吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:39.44", "end": "0:09:40.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:42.62", "end": "0:09:43.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:43.88", "end": "0:09:44.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:47.38", "end": "0:09:47.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:48.50", "end": "0:09:49.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:51.35", "end": "0:09:54.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:54.70", "end": "0:09:56.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种东西由我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:57.72", "end": "0:10:01.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太好了  大丰收大丰收  十三条"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:01.53", "end": "0:10:04.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我不需要那么多  就只要了一条"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:04.65", "end": "0:10:05.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有给实玖瑠的那份"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:09.51", "end": "0:10:11.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只吃一个的话没关系哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:11.89", "end": "0:10:12.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:16.80", "end": "0:10:19.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  有希  你那面具哪里弄来的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:19.94", "end": "0:10:20.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:22.66", "end": "0:10:23.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  是么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:24.25", "end": "0:10:26.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  接下来玩烟花吧  烟花"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:26.71", "end": "0:10:27.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:28.43", "end": "0:10:31.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道「吃饭只吃八分饱」这俗语吗  你这家伙"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:35.11", "end": "0:10:36.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:37.75", "end": "0:10:39.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:40.52", "end": "0:10:43.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:45.96", "end": "0:10:47.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天是捉昆虫呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:47.90", "end": "0:10:51.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:51.63", "end": "0:10:54.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么嘛  那样的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:54.85", "end": "0:10:55.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三天！？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:56.06", "end": "0:11:01.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉再玩到爽"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:01.41", "end": "0:11:03.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:04.21", "end": "0:11:06.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:06.69", "end": "0:11:10.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上天对于人的参数调整还真是随便啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:10.81", "end": "0:11:13.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  明天去捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:13.64", "end": "0:11:17.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人  怎么好呢…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:18.29", "end": "0:11:20.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:21.07", "end": "0:11:21.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "才不要呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:22.04", "end": "0:11:25.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很有趣呢  只要是虫子的话什么都可以么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:27.19", "end": "0:11:29.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…只能抓蝉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:30.23", "end": "0:11:33.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:34.66", "end": "0:11:37.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:38.31", "end": "0:11:41.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团内部的捉蝉大战就在这大晴天下进行"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:42.43", "end": "0:11:46.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说大家都有努力奋斗  可应该说不出所料还是说啥呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:47.24", "end": "0:11:48.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:49.31", "end": "0:11:52.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说到底  还是要有放生的精神"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:53.01", "end": "0:11:56.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:59.75", "end": "0:12:02.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "蝉来了到底能为我们做些啥啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:04.16", "end": "0:12:07.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总觉得  有点打开了盒子的潘多拉的感觉呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:11.00", "end": "0:12:12.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢…欢迎光临"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:13.71", "end": "0:12:17.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  我们在还没搞清状况的状态下就被召集了起来"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:17.75", "end": "0:12:20.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在一无所知的情况下被套上了青蛙的罩衣"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:20.88", "end": "0:12:24.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开始在超市的门口发气球的兼职"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:29.48", "end": "0:12:31.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就像从Adzam Leader中解放一样…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:29.48", "end": "0:12:31.91", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（高达0079中史上最初的MA——アッザム的武器）"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:32.79", "end": "0:12:34.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位辛苦了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:36.00", "end": "0:12:37.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这待遇差算啥啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:40.06", "end": "0:12:41.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "辛苦了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:41.54", "end": "0:12:43.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:44.14", "end": "0:12:45.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:46.12", "end": "0:12:46.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:48.34", "end": "0:12:48.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:49.99", "end": "0:12:50.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:50.70", "end": "0:12:53.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要这个了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:53.45", "end": "0:12:56.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:56.75", "end": "0:13:00.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西累死累活地干活么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 199, "start": "0:13:00.83", "end": "0:13:02.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把这放在社团室做纪念吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:03.13", "end": "0:13:06.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:06.89", "end": "0:13:07.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:15.03", "end": "0:13:17.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那天晚上  夺去了我的安眠的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:18.02", "end": "0:13:19.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是一通电话"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:20.50", "end": "0:13:21.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:21.54", "end": "0:13:22.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:22.78", "end": "0:13:24.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:25.00", "end": "0:13:25.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:26.18", "end": "0:13:31.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是我  这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:32.68", "end": "0:13:33.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 210, "start": "0:13:33.24", "end": "0:13:34.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:34.78", "end": "0:13:36.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么会跟朝比奈学姐在一起"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:37.28", "end": "0:13:42.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况  你能现在就过来么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:44.97", "end": "0:13:47.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底发生什么事了  朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 214, "start": "0:13:50.90", "end": "0:13:51.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 215, "start": "0:13:52.67", "end": "0:13:58.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不了未来了  呜…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:00.32", "end": "0:14:01.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  事情是这样的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:02.41", "end": "0:14:06.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们在永久地重复着同样的时间"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:07.98", "end": "0:14:11.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算你满面春光地把那种非现实的话说出来…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:12.23", "end": "0:14:15.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你知道自己在说什么吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:16.20", "end": "0:14:19.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道  没有比现在更清楚的了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:20.45", "end": "0:14:22.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才和朝比奈学姐谈了下"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:23.07", "end": "0:14:24.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是叫上我啊  这么美的谈话"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:25.34", "end": "0:14:30.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后意识到最近这里时间的流动出现了异常"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:31.14", "end": "0:14:33.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这该说是朝比奈学姐的功绩吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:34.29", "end": "0:14:36.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "托她的福我也确信了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:36.55", "end": "0:14:37.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确信什么了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:38.16", "end": "0:14:43.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们已经重复体验同样的时间许多次了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:43.41", "end": "0:14:44.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个刚才就听你说了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:45.36", "end": "0:14:49.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:50.04", "end": "0:14:53.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正处于一个没有尽头的暑假的正当中"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:54.35", "end": "0:14:56.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在确实是暑假"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:57.25", "end": "0:14:59.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "绝对无法结束的Endless Summer"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 233, "start": "0:15:01.33", "end": "0:15:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这个世界里  九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:07.82", "end": "0:15:10.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐无法回到未来也是因为这个"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:11.27", "end": "0:15:12.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是理所当然的了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:13.34", "end": "0:15:15.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "物理性的No Future哪里理所当然了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:16.35", "end": "0:15:17.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信那个啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:18.53", "end": "0:15:21.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:24.87", "end": "0:15:28.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…也由我来说明一下吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:29.21", "end": "0:15:29.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:30.50", "end": "0:15:36.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为禁止说明的事项  我一直在和未来联系和做禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:38.93", "end": "0:15:44.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一个礼拜左右没有禁止说明的事项了啊  有点奇怪啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:45.41", "end": "0:15:50.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我正这么想着  于是禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:51.31", "end": "0:15:55.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我吓了一大跳  慌张之下就做了禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:57.68", "end": "0:16:02.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但就算是做了  也完全是禁止说明的事项…我到底该怎么办啊…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 246, "start": "0:16:03.19", "end": "0:16:05.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "该怎么办我也不知道啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 247, "start": "0:16:06.25", "end": "0:16:10.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说那个禁止说明的事项是放送禁止用语什么的吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 248, "start": "0:16:12.12", "end": "0:16:16.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我们被困在那个叫什么封闭空间里了吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 249, "start": "0:16:17.78", "end": "0:16:18.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 250, "start": "0:16:19.56", "end": "0:16:22.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一部分的时间被分割开了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:23.34", "end": "0:16:27.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到八月三十一日二十四时整的那一瞬"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:27.70", "end": "0:16:32.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都被重置  再回到十七日的过程"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:35.58", "end": "0:16:36.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 254, "start": "0:16:36.82", "end": "0:16:39.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  全人类的记忆呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 255, "start": "0:16:39.63", "end": "0:16:43.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些也会重置  会重头再来一次"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 256, "start": "0:16:44.49", "end": "0:16:46.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是关于时间这个那个了的问题吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 257, "start": "0:16:47.51", "end": "0:16:50.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然未来人也混进来了  那我觉得也没办法"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 258, "start": "0:16:51.13", "end": "0:16:54.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  这件事和朝比奈学姐没关系"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 259, "start": "0:16:54.38", "end": "0:16:55.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那原因是什么"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 260, "start": "0:16:56.73", "end": "0:16:57.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 261, "start": "0:16:59.73", "end": "0:17:01.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然本人没有这个自觉"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 262, "start": "0:17:01.86", "end": "0:17:07.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 263, "start": "0:17:07.47", "end": "0:17:10.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那算啥啊  难道留着什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 264, "start": "0:17:10.98", "end": "0:17:16.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 265, "start": "0:17:20.13", "end": "0:17:23.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还真是个\n会把一些莫名其妙的事情展开到大宇宙规模的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 266, "start": "0:17:24.29", "end": "0:17:26.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我该怎么办"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:26.56", "end": "0:17:29.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明白了这个的话  就能迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:29.87", "end": "0:17:32.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才我就觉得  你好像乐在其中呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 269, "start": "0:17:33.93", "end": "0:17:35.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知你是不是也这么想"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 270, "start": "0:17:35.94", "end": "0:17:40.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近频繁发生的既视感之谜终于解开了嘛"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:41.03", "end": "0:17:47.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在想来  那只能理解为是由于记忆重置而散落下来的残渣吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:48.76", "end": "0:17:51.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说全世界的人都感觉得到这个吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:52.21", "end": "0:17:56.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样  我和你算是特例了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:57.01", "end": "0:18:01.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像只有和凉宫同学亲近的人才能感觉到这份异样"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 275, "start": "0:18:02.18", "end": "0:18:03.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那春日怎么样"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 276, "start": "0:18:03.69", "end": "0:18:05.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙多少有一点意识到吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 277, "start": "0:18:06.03", "end": "0:18:08.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点都没有呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 278, "start": "0:18:08.69", "end": "0:18:10.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说有了反而糟糕了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 279, "start": "0:18:11.99", "end": "0:18:14.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 280, "start": "0:18:14.45", "end": "0:18:20.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 281, "start": "0:18:21.07", "end": "0:18:23.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁啊  那个人"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:23.24", "end": "0:18:24.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说也该知道吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 283, "start": "0:18:26.15", "end": "0:18:27.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是长门同学"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 284, "start": "0:18:27.66", "end": "0:18:30.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然作为超越了时间的情报统合思念体"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:31.05", "end": "0:18:32.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该是有可能的"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:33.77", "end": "0:18:34.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是这样的吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:35.41", "end": "0:18:35.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:36.89", "end": "0:18:38.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:38.91", "end": "0:18:39.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:40.01", "end": "0:18:43.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  这重复…现在到底几次了？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:43.95", "end": "0:18:47.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15524次"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:49.12", "end": "0:18:50.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15524？"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:51.72", "end": "0:18:54.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15524是啥啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:54.93", "end": "0:18:57.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你在说啥啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:58.64", "end": "0:19:00.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 296, "start": "0:19:00.93", "end": "0:19:01.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 297, "start": "0:19:03.10", "end": "0:19:06.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 298, "start": "0:19:07.62", "end": "0:19:09.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 299, "start": "0:19:09.72", "end": "0:19:20.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15524次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 300, "start": "0:19:20.68", "end": "0:19:26.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 301, "start": "0:19:27.01", "end": "0:19:28.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 302, "start": "0:19:28.42", "end": "0:19:29.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不  已经够了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 303, "start": "0:19:35.07", "end": "0:19:37.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15524次…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 304, "start": "0:19:38.32", "end": "0:19:39.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 305, "start": "0:19:40.17", "end": "0:19:42.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 306, "start": "0:19:42.82", "end": "0:19:44.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是595年的时间了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 307, "start": "0:19:45.57", "end": "0:19:47.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:47.20", "end": "0:19:51.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:52.93", "end": "0:19:57.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都是什么样的心情度过的啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:00.80", "end": "0:20:02.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我又听了荒唐的话了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:04.48", "end": "0:20:06.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天是观测天体"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 312, "start": "0:20:07.42", "end": "0:20:08.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地点是长门的公寓"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 313, "start": "0:20:09.38", "end": "0:20:11.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天体望远镜由古泉准备"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 314, "start": "0:20:12.48", "end": "0:20:14.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我看够了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 315, "start": "0:20:14.81", "end": "0:20:16.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去找UFO吧  UFO"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 316, "start": "0:20:29.28", "end": "0:20:31.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 317, "start": "0:20:31.76", "end": "0:20:33.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 318, "start": "0:20:35.01", "end": "0:20:36.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:37.44", "end": "0:20:39.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 320, "start": "0:20:39.91", "end": "0:20:42.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 321, "start": "0:20:44.06", "end": "0:20:45.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 322, "start": "0:20:45.96", "end": "0:20:48.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你没有适合的人了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 323, "start": "0:20:48.76", "end": "0:20:50.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我等的就是你这句话"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 324, "start": "0:20:50.87", "end": "0:20:51.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…话说  谁会做啊"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 325, "start": "0:20:52.58", "end": "0:20:54.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 326, "start": "0:20:58.03", "end": "0:20:59.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:05.26", "end": "0:21:08.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们之后去了击球中心"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:11.40", "end": "0:21:12.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  长门"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:12.84", "end": "0:21:16.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在朝比奈同学说出来之前就注意到了这轮回吧"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:16.92", "end": "0:21:17.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:17.79", "end": "0:21:19.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那为什么沉默不语"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:20.61", "end": "0:21:22.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我的工作是观察"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:24.13", "end": "0:21:25.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打中了！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:33.22", "end": "0:21:34.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是我赢啦"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:35.85", "end": "0:21:36.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊～"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 336, "start": "0:21:43.29", "end": "0:21:44.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "延长啊！"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 337, "start": "0:21:48.30", "end": "0:21:50.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样课题就如实地完成了呢"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 338, "start": "0:21:52.45", "end": "0:21:54.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样子好吗"}
