{"ep": "17", "idx": 345, "start": "0:22:17.07", "end": "0:22:18.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "17", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:19.31", "end": "0:22:22.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
